## **OVERVIEW**

ZATCA Phase 2 & Egyptian ETA compliance:
- **E-Invoice Generation** - XML format
- **Hash Chain** - Tamper-proof sequence
- **Digital Signature** - Cryptographic signing
- **Submission** - Real-time to government
- **QR Code** - TLV format

