---

## **KEY POINTS**

✅ **Decimal.js** used throughout calculations  
✅ **7-step pipeline** calculates totals  
✅ **Event-driven** - Inventory/Compliance auto-triggered  
✅ **FIFO** - Oldest stock deducted first  
