## **OFFLINE HANDLING**

```typescript
// If ZATCA is offline, queue for retry
if (error.code === 'ZATCA_UNAVAILABLE') {
  await prisma.invoiceSubmissionQueue.create({
    data: {
      invoiceId: invoice.id,
      attempts: 0,
      status: 'PENDING',
    },
  });

  // Background job retries every 5 minutes
