```

**Fixed Code**:
```typescript
ctx.taxAmount = ctx.subtotalBeforeTax
  .times(ctx.taxPercent)
  .dividedBy(100)
  .toDecimalPlaces(2, Decimal.ROUND_HALF_UP); // ✅ ZATCA compliant
